  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Among the given option (a) is a diamagnetic complex.</p><p>(a) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Co</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>Co</mi><mfenced><mn>27</mn></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>Co</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>0</mn></msup></math>.</p><p>Thus, has no unpaired electrons and is a diamagnetic complex.</p><p>(b) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>NiCl</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>Ni</mi><mfenced><mn>28</mn></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>Ni</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>8</mn></msup><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>0</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Thus, has two unpaired electrons is paramagnetic.</p><p>(c) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>CuCl</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>Cu</mi><mfenced><mn>29</mn></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>9</mn></msup><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>0</mn></msup></math></p><p>Thus, has one unpaired electrons and is paramagnetic.</p><p>(d) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Fe</mi><msub><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>Fe</mi><mfenced><mn>26</mn></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>0</mn></msup></math></p><p>Thus, has five unpaired electrons and is paramagnetic.</p>",
